 usecase "Mengisi profil\nusia 6–12 tahun" as P
 usecase "Pemetaan awal\ndan rekomendasi" as D
 usecase "Lesson dan\nbantuan belajar" as L
 usecase "Mastery" as M
 usecase "Melihat progres\ndan bukti skill" as R
}
Siswa -- P
Siswa -- D
Siswa -- L
Siswa -- M
Siswa -- R
P -- Wali
L -- Wali
R -- Wali
@enduml
